请审查以下二分查找函数并指出它的死循环 bug，然后给出修复后的正确 Python 代码：
```python
def binary_search(arr, target):
    left, right = 0, len(arr) - 1
    while left < right:
        mid = (left + right) // 2
        if arr[mid] == target:
            return mid
        elif arr[mid] < target:
            left = mid
        else:
            right = mid - 1
    return -1
```
